  "title": "Norway: TotalEnergies divests its non-operated interest in West Ekofisk, Albuskjell and Tommeliten Gamma fields",
  "summary": "Paris, October 1, 2025 – TotalEnergies EP Norge has signed an agreement for the divestment of its non-operated interest (39.89%) in the West Ekofisk and Albuskjell fields to Vår Energi and has also concluded an agreement with Orlen Upstream Norway for the divestment of its non-operated interest (20.23%) in the Tommeliten Gamma field. […]",
